/given-names></name><name><surname>Sheen</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>MAP kinase signaling cascade in <italic>Arabidopsis</italic> innate immunity</article-title><source>Nature</source><year>2002</year><volume>415</volume><fpage>977</fpage><lpage>983</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11875555</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="bib6"><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Berger</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Sinha</surname><given-names>AK</given-names></name><name><surname>Roitsch</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Plant physiology meets phytopathology: plant primary metabolism and plant&#x02013;pathogen interactions</article-title><source>Journal of Experimental Botany</source><year>2007</year><volume>58</volume><fpage>4019</fpage><lpage>4026</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18182420</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="bib7"><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bruce</surname><given-names>TJA</given-names></name><name><surname>Pickett</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Plant defence signaling induced by biotic attacks</article-title><source>Current Opinion in Plant Biology</source><year>2007</year><volume>10</volume><fpage>387</fpage><lpage>392</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17627867</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="bib8"><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Burdon</surname><given-names>JJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Trall</surname><given-names>PH</given-names></name><name><surname>Ericson</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The current and future dynamics of disease in plant communities</article-title><source>Annual Review of Phytopathology</source><year>2006